{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC expands the base game with new content and introduces a late-game challenge against the Wizard King himself. Will your adventurers conquer the Tower and reach its summit or will the Wizard King remain undefeated?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Class Line:</strong> Spearman \u2192 Impaler \u2192 Stormpiercer</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful melee fighter with extended reach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports allies with precise, high-accuracy follow-up attacks</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Advanced Class: Ninja</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid your team from the shadows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy shadow clones to confuse and disrupt enemies</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Quest Location: The Tower of the Wizard King</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend floor by floor, facing ever-stronger enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Wizard King Coins instead of standard loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend coins on exclusive items in Me\u2019can\u2019s shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>Boons</strong> to aid your climb or <strong>Burdens</strong> for greater rewards</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brand-new quests and assignments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce new enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 challenging boss battles</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983380?t=1758897533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983380?t=175889